The pinned toolchain is present, but the audit sandbox prevents Lean’s `IO.appPath` from resolving its own executable; setting explicit Lake/Lean roots gets past Lake detection and isolates the failure to Lean itself. I’m testing that path-resolution boundary directly so I can distinguish a fixable environment quirk from a genuine preflight blocker.
